edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T07:29:52-07:00","id":1491759,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah, another thing I was wondering. I never really groked the theme for immortal, is it abt how you spend eternity or is it abt living in constant paranoia of getting SCHWACKED at any moment(kinda like in Dragon and even demon to some extent)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27062-vampires-suck","name":"VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27062_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T08:12:14-07:00","id":1491765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>VAMPIRES SUCK!!!!!</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1486311-updating-immortal-the-gathering-for-cofd?p=1491759#post1491759\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh yeah, another thing I was wondering. I never really groked the theme for immortal, is it abt how you spend eternity or is it abt living in constant paranoia of getting SCHWACKED at any moment (kinda like in Dragon and even demon to some extent)?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The theme is <i>&quot;Immortality has a price&quot;</i>, which is not a healthy price. Blood Bathers become serial killers. Body Thieves need to reinvent their role in society with each hop and create tears in people's lives with each victim they take. Purified need to be ever vigilant so as to not appear weak before spirits, or they will face a fate far worse than death, being consumed in a way that is just as absolute as diablerie is for a vampire. Highlanders live in a <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/ForeverWar\" target=\"_blank\">Forever War</a> (as far as they know) against people who lived through most of history, all the while struggling to retain their sanity as their mind shatters trying to cope with the supernatural.<br /> <br /> All that before taking into account having to reinvent yourself every once in a while to throw people off the trail, dodging those who would see them as research subjects, surviving the supernatural horrors that infest the world, seeing all mortals they care about wither and die, seeing civilization drift so far away from the familiar that they feel isolated and much more. Can the equation be balanced ? Perhaps, with the right approach, but it's not a journey everyone would take in stride and the Immortal that emerges from it will likely not be any paragon of morality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://fo